{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23578","headline":"夜归 · 白居易","name":"夜归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逐胜移朝宴，留欢放晚衙。\n宾寮多谢客，骑从半吴娃。\n到处销春景，归时及月华。\n城阴一道直，烛焰两行斜。\n东吹先催柳，南霜不杀花。\n臯桥夜沽酒，灯火是谁家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}